{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "995f04c095c6b415713d0bf437c1bdb34438571688d4be63d76d0a0537285783", "ja": "グルメ番組のお仕事", "zh": "美食节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4000_place", "source_sha256": "a4a86df0b3ab69d5c3ded8d58b14ae70ef1d3548e7b7dd4704eb2379c5f8eb30", "ja": "レジャースポット", "zh": "游憩场所", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4001_013hib", "source_sha256": "162ca005a02fafbd58c2c7865c757344725c3f20653d2dfdc9c73028fa2fa37b", "ja": "うぎゃー！　{$P$}！\n自分はどうすればいいんだー！？", "zh": "呜呀──！{$P$}！\n本人该怎么做才好──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4002_p", "source_sha256": "5a12b4ca20d780b7908f2c4aca4501d0007c517ae016d333481b713ce5177873", "ja": "おいおい、急にどうしたんだ、響？", "zh": "喂喂，突然怎么了，响？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4003_013hib", "source_sha256": "c14cc53bae2c0c935e96574d1822c662ba9dfdf55a64617cc055ee3538bac094", "ja": "この後、グルメリポートの撮影があるでしょ？\nだから昨日、練習してみたんだけど……。", "zh": "等一下不是要录美食报导吗？\n所以本人昨天有练习过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4004_013hib", "source_sha256": "a0dfe22c493b50df02f35ad0368dcd79d2f2ec28f04d4dc2082bf6b488459f44", "ja": "自分、おいしいものを食べたら、「おいしい」とか、\n「うまい」しか言えないって気付いちゃったんだ！", "zh": "可是本人发现自己吃下美食以后，\n只说得出「好吃」、「美味」这种感想啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4005_013hib", "source_sha256": "16d3c6c2ed691dce6e63681b93ed3e612a570a98992f3964d3f3123544e35a48", "ja": "これじゃあ、リポートなんてできないかも……。\nねえ、どうすればいいのー！？", "zh": "这样子，本人说不定没办法报导……\n欸，该怎么办才好──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4006_p", "source_sha256": "ae1c0833a6243d0341bfb239f3a5bb973a6b90b334a76f9b58c5277da7b1afcd", "ja": "上手なグルメリポートの仕方か。そうだな……。", "zh": "做好美食报导的方法啊，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4007", "source_sha256": "fa7dd799f665ba1fe05596590b7c23dbace10acfe2e2dd727ec54c431e443390", "ja": "感じたまま表現", "zh": "以真实的感受来表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4008", "source_sha256": "1479766a87ec8b346b9cf5885690344d92a7148ea2b74ded1b298c48615df932", "ja": "方言で表現", "zh": "以方言来表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4009", "source_sha256": "144b93303f271d945f5c7266adfbdfe493fdcd22b8fd468bfc44d557ecfbfc7e", "ja": "通な言葉で表現", "zh": "以专业术语来表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4100_p", "source_sha256": "a2770a90f0f86edd67f1449cae8510b0c93d57f8b534c5686c25983037c8fab7", "ja": "響が感じたままリポートすればいいと思う。\n無理したところで、味は伝わらないからな。", "zh": "直接把响真实的感受报导出来就行了。\n勉强去形容，也无法把味道传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4101_013hib", "source_sha256": "7d5bc5f76500611d463641fdbf3727f72b4ed20139c3d785d75de0617bafc2e1", "ja": "え？　でも自分、たぶん同じことしか言えないぞ？", "zh": "咦？可是本人大概讲来讲去都是同一句话喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4102_p", "source_sha256": "11359d407c70627f2b432bf810ae71486389b9398b7e75357470296db69e041c", "ja": "同じ言葉でも、気持ちが違えば大丈夫！\n素直な響だからこそ、気持ちが言い方に出るから。", "zh": "就算是同样的话，只要内含的情感不同就没问题！\n正因为响的个性直率，言谈中自然就能流露出真心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4103_013hib", "source_sha256": "3c7c202d380f5bb0ec9127dda7ff548ed8c93b4c7f6bba493986423b8205ddc7", "ja": "じゃあ、その時の気持ちのまま言えばいいんだね？　\nそれなら大得意だぞ！　絶対、いいリポートにするね！", "zh": "那本人只要按照当下的感受说出来就行了吧？\n那样的话本人很擅长喔！本人绝对会做出好报导的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4200_p", "source_sha256": "4c72a250ef3d4e251f2de79f55e9bc456847cc82cb992150a193f8f607b5753d", "ja": "響らしく、沖縄の言葉で、\nおいしさを表現してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "就以响的风格，\n用方言来表达有多么好吃如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4201_013hib", "source_sha256": "2169686addb0031297c6a418ddfb372270cdda6e9f3adca02059da9876b7f1f2", "ja": "ええっと……、\nいっぺーまーさんどー！　とか……？", "zh": "呃……\n就厚呷欸啦～！这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4202_013hib", "source_sha256": "d7e208d2322430f563bc1a44d8c1bdfae95584732d1f0b5a02bb4bb73f6e14e1", "ja": "う～ん、自分はいいけど、みんなにちゃんと\n伝わるのかな……。心配だぞ～。", "zh": "唔～本人是做得到，但这样\n真的能传达给大家吗……很让人担心喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4300_p", "source_sha256": "965d33ae9052451d33f659c86bb1659ff9f9d38d7711e9fd9b0c46c88f902475", "ja": "グルメリポートらしく、こう、\n通な言葉での表現に挑戦してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "就像个美食评论家一样，\n挑战以专业术语来表现如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4301_013hib", "source_sha256": "87404c92f7f315569ca4cb273539332ea58b3a39180228d3c32c09e9dcba66a3", "ja": "ツウな言葉？　よくわかんないけど……。\nとりあえず、そんな感じでリポートやってみるね！", "zh": "专业术语？本人不是很懂耶……\n总之，本人会以那种感觉来介绍看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_4302_013hib", "source_sha256": "daaf3d50a0361a5f738a65963f2d60742390ee071b0dad9ff828d5363ff3b29d", "ja": "この肉、キレとコクがあってしつこくて……。\nね、ネバっと……。うう～、なんか違うぞ～！", "zh": "这肉劲道十足，味道浓郁又有层次感……\n黏、黏腻的……呜呜～感觉不太对喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
